<view class="screen has-bottom"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="mode-banner">演示发布只保存在当前设备，不会发给另一半。</view><view class="compose-intro"><view class="subtle">SAVE A LITTLE MOMENT</view><view>今天，有什么想和 TA 分享？</view></view><view class="card compose-card"><text class="input-label">这一刻的标题（选填）</text><input aria-label="回忆标题，选填" placeholder-style="color:#766962" class="compose-title" value="{{title}}" bindinput="input" data-field="title" maxlength="60" placeholder="给这个瞬间起个名字（选填）"/><text class="field-label">想记住的话</text><textarea aria-label="回忆正文" placeholder-style="color:#766962" class="compose-body" value="{{body}}" bindinput="input" data-field="body" maxlength="5000" auto-height="{{true}}" placeholder="一顿好吃的晚餐，一件想吐槽的小事，或者单纯想说一句：今天也在想你。"/><view class="character-count">{{body.length}} / 5000</view><view class="compose-photos"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="index" class="photo-cell"><image lazy-load="true" aria-label="回忆照片，第 {{index + 1}} 张" src="{{item.url || item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.url || item.path}}" bindtap="preview"/><button aria-label="移除第 {{index + 1}} 张照片" class="remove-photo" data-index="{{index}}" catchtap="remove">×</button></view><button wx:if="{{images.length < 9}}" class="photo-add" bindtap="photos"><text>＋</text><view>添加照片</view></button></view><view class="subtle photo-help">最多 9 张照片 · 单张 8MB 以内</view><view class="divider"></view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date"><view class="between"><text class="small muted">这个瞬间发生在</text><text class="small blue">{{date}} ›</text></view></picker></view><view class="notice">仅你们两个人可以查看。内容会自动保留为手机草稿，发布成功后再清空。</view><button class="link" bindtap="clearDraft">新写一篇 / 清空当前草稿</button><view class="fixed-bottom"><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !ready}}" bindtap="publish">{{id ? '保存这篇回忆' : '收藏这个瞬间'}}</button></view></view>
